{"3476950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Campoca", "steam_appid": 3476950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/133e25240fad2331d53fd462adf2c120.avif?t=1772476285\" width=800 height=82 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/475bdaca8ae6a26f78f7fe4489acf7fa.poster.avif?t=1772476285\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/475bdaca8ae6a26f78f7fe4489acf7fa.webm?t=1772476285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/475bdaca8ae6a26f78f7fe4489acf7fa.mp4?t=1772476285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of pure joy with the game <strong><i>Campoca</i></strong>. This game is  your go-to feel-good experience, filled with fun minigames and surprises! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/81409afd9e52cf820cb1c8b47b89f2e3.avif?t=1772476285\" width=800 height=83 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an interactive wonderland where every element is designed to bring a smile to your face. This game brings happiness right into your heart with very simple controls - just bring your mouse or trackpad!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/38c1aa7f8d267b0d0475173ea0fcdd72.avif?t=1772476285\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the campsite and earn rewards from feel-good activities and use them to decorate your very own space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/712071d3172c56f52dccc280c46fbe6e.avif?t=1772476285\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in <i>Campoca </i>is absolutely free to download and play, with no in-game purchases or data collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/ef2352f3b76c74b6e900f678272f690f.avif?t=1772476285\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/5b495065b83db58da1290cae7ae647dd.poster.avif?t=1772476285\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/5b495065b83db58da1290cae7ae647dd.webm?t=1772476285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/5b495065b83db58da1290cae7ae647dd.mp4?t=1772476285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campoca is where wholesome relaxation awaits you. Every moment is designed to fill your heart with the happiness, something much needed today! </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/133e25240fad2331d53fd462adf2c120.avif?t=1772476285\" width=800 height=82 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/475bdaca8ae6a26f78f7fe4489acf7fa.poster.avif?t=1772476285\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/475bdaca8ae6a26f78f7fe4489acf7fa.webm?t=1772476285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/475bdaca8ae6a26f78f7fe4489acf7fa.mp4?t=1772476285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of pure joy with the game <strong><i>Campoca</i></strong>. This game is  your go-to feel-good experience, filled with fun minigames and surprises! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/81409afd9e52cf820cb1c8b47b89f2e3.avif?t=1772476285\" width=800 height=83 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an interactive wonderland where every element is designed to bring a smile to your face. This game brings happiness right into your heart with very simple controls - just bring your mouse or trackpad!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/38c1aa7f8d267b0d0475173ea0fcdd72.avif?t=1772476285\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the campsite and earn rewards from feel-good activities and use them to decorate your very own space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/712071d3172c56f52dccc280c46fbe6e.avif?t=1772476285\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in <i>Campoca </i>is absolutely free to download and play, with no in-game purchases or data collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/ef2352f3b76c74b6e900f678272f690f.avif?t=1772476285\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/5b495065b83db58da1290cae7ae647dd.poster.avif?t=1772476285\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/5b495065b83db58da1290cae7ae647dd.webm?t=1772476285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/extras/5b495065b83db58da1290cae7ae647dd.mp4?t=1772476285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campoca is where wholesome relaxation awaits you. Every moment is designed to fill your heart with the happiness, something much needed today! </p>", "short_description": "Enter Campoca, where feel-good activities and delightful interactions are yours to enjoy completely for free! Collect joyful memories and turn your campsite into a charming, heartwarming retreat!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476950/343547855baaefc94a93af9c4636b6d0146a4aa5/he